:temNumeroVarredurasUtil rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                         rdfs:domain :AccessStructure ;
                         rdfs:range xsd:int .


###  http://www.owl-ontologies.com/OntologiaTuning.owl#temOrdem
:temOrdem rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
          rdfs:domain :Column ;
